// What was wrong: the keep-evidence arm of run_consolidation erased the older
// rows from `ledger` and then called amem::save_ledger, so the durable file
// lost them. How it was measured: the reader bounds itself already — a 40-row
// ledger renders 8 rows / 6,371 bytes against the 7,300-byte
// Costs::personality_chars budget (amem::ledger_cap and
