                    // synthesis takes ~1 s and his endpoint can arrive inside
                    // it. Removing a file that is not there yet leaves the
                    // late .done to be swallowed by the coming turn's TTS wait
                    // as its own completion. Wait it out, bounded: the clip is
                    // under a second of audio, so 2.5 s covers a stalled
                    // daemon without stalling the conversation.
                    // r19.6 (C59): non-blocking first pass.
                    //
                    // This sits between his endpoint and EVERYTHING that
                    // produces a reply — whisper, the emotion tag, the prompt
                    // decode, generation. The `.done` is written when the clip
                    // has finished PLAYING, so the loop used to block for the
                    // remaining synthesis and playback of a backchannel that may
                    // have started a fraction of a second before he stopped
                    // talking: up to 2.5 s of dead air on exactly the turns
